h - 0.15)\n  :timeout -> max(0.0, old_strength - 0.05)\nend"},{"id":"blk-46156","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-53102","text":"Tests"}]},{"id":"blk-46157","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-46159","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-53103","text":"Successful outcome strengthens causal edge"}]}],"id":"blk-46158","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-46161","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-53104","text":"Failed outcome weakens causal edge"}]}],"id":"blk-46160","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-46163","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-53105","text":"causal_strength persists in edge metadata"}]}],"id":"blk-46162","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-46165","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-53106","text":"confounders field accepted and stored"}]}],"id":"blk-46164","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-46166","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-53107","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-46167","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-53108","text":"GraphMemBench Phase 3: Full Suite + Competitor Stubs (3 days)"}]},{"id":"blk-46168","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-53109","text":"Add remaining 40 scenarios (Categories 11-15, 8 each)"}]},{"id":"blk-46169","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-53110","marks":["bold"],"text":"Category 11: Causal Metadata (8 scenarios)"}]},{"id":"blk-46170","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-46172","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-53111","text":"causal_strength updates on outcome success"}]}],"id":"blk-46171","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-46174","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-53112","text":"causal_strength decreases on failure"}]}],"id":"blk-46173","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-46176","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-53113","text":"confounders stored in edge metadata"}]}],"id":"blk-46175","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-46178","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-53114","text":"Causal subgraph extraction (al